1427	+func distillEvalJudgePrompt() string {
1428	+	return `You review candidate repository memories extracted from one AI coding session.
1429	+For each FACT below, decide whether it deserves to exist as a durable memory
1430	+for this repository, applying all four checks:
1431	+
1432	+  1. DURABLE — still relevant a week or a month from now?
1433	+  2. USEFUL — would a future session genuinely benefit, or is it obvious?
1434	+  3. NOT ALREADY KNOWN — not discoverable from the code, git log, or README?
1435	+  4. WORTH WRITING DOWN — would a senior engineer record this in onboarding
1436	+     notes, or roll their eyes at it?
1437	+
1438	+A fact failing ANY check is kill. Ephemeral task state, restated code, tool
1439	+mechanics, and session-only feedback are kill.
1440	+
1441	+Output exactly one line per fact, in fact-number order:
1442	+
1443	+    <fact#> <keep|kill>
1444	+
1445	+Output only these lines. No prose.`
